Z||000018||stimpy||09-24-2001||01:33 PM||||I mounted my $12 Kidde ABC extinguisher under the map pocket on the dash. Problem with other mounting spots (such as on the A pillar or by the rear window) is that fire extinguishers really don't carefor direct sunlight. One word of caution, make SUREyou mount it somewhere firmly. Velcro don't cut it. Extinguishers can become little steel missles in an accident of severity. Be safe, folks.||||reg||1
Z||000019||SLYGUY||09-24-2001||02:52 PM||||Im gonna mount a little extinguisher in the forward compartment myself. A fire can be an inexpensive fix or a complete disaster. Gotta be prepared.<P>Sly<P>P.S. Great site Lisa. Love what you have done with the car. ||||reg||1
